flowchart TB

  v_events["For a positive result, the <br/>default Poll processes <br/>notifiers before timers."]
  v_notifiers["It emits activated when a <br/>registered Read notifier <br/>has a matching valid event."]
  v_activated["The activated signal of the <br/>notifier waiting for a <br/>fence is connected to <br/>notifierActivated."]
  v_notifier{"It retrieves the signalled <br/>fence with releaseFence, <br/>removes its notifier, and <br/>checks for remaining <br/>notifiers."}
  v_timer["When the last fence <br/>completes, timer#95;.reset <br/>destroys the Timer."]
  v_stop["The destructor calls stop. <br/>A running timer is <br/>unregistered on the correct <br/>thread."]
  v_timers["It processes a timer if it <br/>remains registered and its <br/>deadline has passed. Expiry <br/>alone does not guarantee <br/>that timeout runs first."]
  v_timeout["timeout clears the <br/>remaining notifiers#95; and <br/>cancels the request. An <br/>unsignalled fence remains <br/>in the buffer and must be <br/>retrieved with <br/>FrameBuffer::releaseFence <br/>before reuse."]
  v_prepared["It emits preparation <br/>completion. The request may <br/>still be cancelled due to a <br/>later device error."]
